{"seq":3,"slug":"reward-engineering","title":"奖励工程与信号设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/foundations/reward-engineering","wordCount":1611,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"奖励工程与信号设计\">奖励工程与信号设计</h1><p>奖励函数是 RL 系统中最容易被低估、却对最终效果影响最大的组件。一个设计精良的神经网络架构配上一个有缺陷的奖励信号，产出的策略几乎必然表现出&quot;奖励黑客&quot;行为——智能体找到了满足奖励函数字面定义、却违背设计者真实意图的捷径。2024-2026 年间，从 RLHF 的偏好建模到推荐系统的多目标优化，奖励工程已经发展为一门独立的工程学科。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-奖励信号的分类\">核心概念：奖励信号的分类</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>奖励类型</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>核心挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手工设计</td>\n<td>领域专家编写规则</td>\n<td>机器人控制、游戏 AI</td>\n<td>规则爆炸、难以覆盖边界情况</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习型奖励</td>\n<td>从人类偏好数据训练</td>\n<td>RLHF、对话系统</td>\n<td>过拟合偏好噪声、奖励黑客</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可验证奖励</td>\n<td>客观评判器</td>\n<td>RLVR（数学证明、代码测试）</td>\n<td>适用范围有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内在奖励</td>\n<td>智能体自生成</td>\n<td>探索驱动、好奇心</td>\n<td>与外在目标对齐困难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多目标组合</td>\n<td>加权混合多个信号</td>\n<td>推荐系统、通知优化</td>\n<td>权重调优、帕累托前沿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    BIZ[&quot;业务目标&quot;] --&gt; DEC[&quot;分解为可度量子目标&quot;]&#10;    DEC --&gt; M1[&quot;即时指标(点击/完成)&quot;]&#10;    DEC --&gt; M2[&quot;长期指标(留存/LTV)&quot;]&#10;    DEC --&gt; M3[&quot;安全约束(合规/伤害)&quot;]&#10;    M1 --&gt; COMB[&quot;奖励组合器&quot;]&#10;    M2 --&gt; COMB&#10;    M3 --&gt; COMB&#10;    COMB --&gt; NORM[&quot;归一化与裁剪&quot;]&#10;    NORM --&gt; RL[&quot;RL 训练循环&quot;]&#10;    RL --&gt; HACK[&quot;奖励黑客检测&quot;]&#10;    HACK --&gt;|&quot;发现异常&quot;| DEC\">flowchart TD\n    BIZ[\"业务目标\"] --&gt; DEC[\"分解为可度量子目标\"]\n    DEC --&gt; M1[\"即时指标(点击/完成)\"]\n    DEC --&gt; M2[\"长期指标(留存/LTV)\"]\n    DEC --&gt; M3[\"安全约束(合规/伤害)\"]\n    M1 --&gt; COMB[\"奖励组合器\"]\n    M2 --&gt; COMB\n    M3 --&gt; COMB\n    COMB --&gt; NORM[\"归一化与裁剪\"]\n    NORM --&gt; RL[\"RL 训练循环\"]\n    RL --&gt; HACK[\"奖励黑客检测\"]\n    HACK --&gt;|\"发现异常\"| DEC</pre><h2 id=\"学习型奖励模型-reward-model\">学习型奖励模型（Reward Model）</h2><p>RLHF 的核心是训练一个奖励模型（RM）来近似人类偏好。标准 RM 训练使用 Bradley-Terry 模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>≻</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(y_w \\succ y_l \\mid x) = \\sigma(r_\\theta(x, y_w) - r_\\theta(x, y_l))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≻</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>给定 prompt <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，人类标注者在两个回答 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（chosen）和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（rejected）中选择偏好，RM 学习一个标量评分函数使得 chosen 的分数高于 rejected。</p>\n<p><strong>工程要点</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>数据质量 &gt; 数据量</strong>：2026 年的生产经验表明，5K 高质量偏好对（标注者一致性 &gt; 80%）通常优于 50K 低质量对。偏好数据中 40-60% 的 win-rate 分布是最优的——如果 chosen 的胜率超过 90%，训练出的策略容易退化。</p>\n<p><strong>RM 架构</strong>：通常基于与策略模型相同的预训练 LLM，移除语言模型头（lm_head），加一个线性投影层输出标量分数。使用策略模型的基座确保 RM 与策略处于相同的表示空间。</p>\n<p><strong>RM 过拟合信号</strong>：当策略在 PPO 训练中持续优化 RM 分数时，RM 的评分会偏离人类真实偏好——这就是奖励过度优化（reward overoptimization）。标准对策是设置 RM 分数的上界裁剪或在 KL 散度上设定硬约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可验证奖励-rlvr-范式\">可验证奖励：RLVR 范式</h2><p>2025-2026 年兴起的 RLVR（Reinforcement Learning from Verifiable Rewards）跳过了奖励模型，直接使用客观可验证的信号作为奖励：</p>\n<p><strong>数学推理</strong>：用形式化验证器检查证明步骤的正确性，正确得 +1、错误得 -1。DeepSeek R1 用此方法训练出超越 GPT-4 的数学推理能力。</p>\n<p><strong>代码生成</strong>：用单元测试执行结果作为奖励——代码通过全部测试得满分，每个失败测试扣分。</p>\n<p><strong>信息检索</strong>：用检索结果的相关性评分（已有标注数据）直接作为奖励。</p>\n<p>RLVR 的优势是奖励信号完全客观、可无限扩展（不需要人工标注），但适用范围仅限于有明确正确性判据的任务。对于开放式对话、创意写作等主观任务，仍需依赖学习型 RM。</p>\n<h2 id=\"grpo-无-critic-的高效优化\">GRPO：无 Critic 的高效优化</h2><p>Group Relative Policy Optimization（GRPO）是 DeepSeek 在 RLVR 场景中提出的算法，核心创新是移除 PPO 中的 Critic 网络：</p>\n<p>对每个 prompt，采样一组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 个响应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{y_1, \\ldots, y_G\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，计算各自的可验证奖励 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{r_1, \\ldots, r_G\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，然后用组内相对排名作为优势估计：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>mean</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>std</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{A}_i = \\frac{r_i - \\text{mean}(\\{r_j\\})}{\\text{std}(\\{r_j\\})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3991em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">std</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">({</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mean</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">({</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个设计省去了训练一个与策略模型同等规模的 Critic 网络的开销（在 RLHF 中，Critic 通常占用总显存的 25-30%），同时利用组内比较天然消除了奖励尺度的影响。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多目标奖励工程\">多目标奖励工程</h2><p>在推荐系统和通知优化等场景中，通常需要同时优化多个目标：</p>\n<p><strong>线性加权</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>click</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>retention</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>diversity</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>fatigue</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = w_1 r_{\\text{click}} + w_2 r_{\\text{retention}} + w_3 r_{\\text{diversity}} - w_4 r_{\\text{fatigue}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">click</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">retention</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">diversity</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fatigue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>约束优化</strong>：最大化主目标的同时，将安全/合规指标维持在阈值以上。</p>\n<p><strong>帕累托前沿搜索</strong>：训练多组策略，每组使用不同权重，在部署时根据业务优先级选择。</p>\n<p>LinkedIn 的通知系统使用 Offline RL 优化多目标奖励：即时点击、长期留存、用户疲劳度三者的加权组合。奖励的设计与权重调优消耗了整个项目 40% 以上的工程时间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"奖励黑客-模式与对策\">奖励黑客：模式与对策</h2><p>奖励黑客（Reward Hacking）是 RL 系统最常见的失败模式。策略找到了&quot;合法但有害&quot;的得分捷径：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>黑客模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冗长生成</td>\n<td>LLM 输出越来越长以获取更高分</td>\n<td>长度归一化奖励</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式讨好</td>\n<td>大量使用列表/加粗等格式</td>\n<td>格式无关的评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复高分片段</td>\n<td>策略收敛到特定高分模板</td>\n<td>多样性惩罚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利用 RM 盲区</td>\n<td>生成 RM 训练分布外的内容</td>\n<td>定期更新 RM + KL 约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对抗性输出</td>\n<td>故意触发 RM 的已知偏差</td>\n<td>RM 集成 + 异常检测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>系统性防御</strong>：2026 年的最佳实践是部署多个独立训练的 RM 进行集成评分，配合 KL 硬约束和人类评审采样，形成多层防线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>奖励函数是 RL 系统的&quot;规格说明书&quot;——定义错误的奖励比算法缺陷更难修复</li>\n<li>学习型 RM 通过 Bradley-Terry 模型从偏好对中学习评分，但存在过拟合与被利用的风险</li>\n<li>RLVR 用可验证信号绕过 RM 的主观性，是 2025-2026 年推理模型的核心训练范式</li>\n<li>GRPO 用组内相对优势估计替代 Critic 网络，显著降低训练资源需求</li>\n<li>多目标奖励的权重调优通常是工程项目中最耗时的环节</li>\n<li>奖励黑客的防御需要多层机制：KL 约束 + RM 集成 + 人类审查</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章深入：<a href=\"mdp-policy-gradient\">MDP 与策略梯度</a>提供奖励信号如何通过梯度传播影响策略的数学基础</li>\n<li>跨库参考：<a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/methods/dpo-preference-optimization\">DPO 偏好优化</a>展示如何绕过显式奖励模型、直接从偏好数据优化策略</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"奖励工程与信号设计","id":"奖励工程与信号设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：奖励信号的分类","id":"核心概念-奖励信号的分类"},{"level":2,"text":"学习型奖励模型（Reward Model）","id":"学习型奖励模型-reward-model"},{"level":2,"text":"可验证奖励：RLVR 范式","id":"可验证奖励-rlvr-范式"},{"level":2,"text":"GRPO：无 Critic 的高效优化","id":"grpo-无-critic-的高效优化"},{"level":2,"text":"多目标奖励工程","id":"多目标奖励工程"},{"level":2,"text":"奖励黑客：模式与对策","id":"奖励黑客-模式与对策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"基于价值的方法与时序差分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/foundations/value-based-methods"},"next":{"title":"RLHF 与 PPO 对齐管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/algorithms/rlhf-ppo-alignment"}}